        'instructions' => "Attach a rope to a low pulley, face away from the machine, and stand astride the cable with feet a little wider than shoulder-width.\nGrip the rope between your legs with both hands and walk forward until the cable is under tension.\nWith soft knees and a flat back, push your hips back and let your hands travel back between your legs.\nDrive your hips forward to stand tall, squeezing your glutes and exhaling at the top while your arms stay straight.\nHinge back again with control and repeat.",
