        'description' => 'A cardio exercise on the treadmill that works the quadriceps, with the hamstrings, glutes and calves assisting.',
        'description_ar' => 'تمرين كارديو على التريدميل يشغّل العضلات الأمامية للفخذ، مع مشاركة العضلات الخلفية للفخذ وعضلات الأرداف والسمانة.',
        'instructions' => "Stand on the side rails, clip on the safety key if there is one, and start the belt at a slow walking speed.\nWarm up for about 5 minutes, building gradually from a brisk walk to an easy jog.\nRaise the speed to your working pace: you should be breathing hard but still able to say a few words.\nRun with an upright posture, relaxed shoulders, and short, light steps that land under your body.\nCool down for about 5 minutes by gradually reducing the speed to a walk before stopping the belt.",
